  Further reading
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/using-presigned-url.html" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Amazon S3 presigned URLs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/access-control/signed-urls" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Google Cloud Storage signed URLs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://cloudinary.com/documentation/image_transformations" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Cloudinary image transformations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.imgix.com/setup/securing-images" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;imgix securing images&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/images/manage-images/serve-images/serve-private-images-using-signed-url-tokens/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Cloudflare Images signed URLs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
